1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,900
LEO: Our garden is dying... but we water it every single day!

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,900
LEO: So where is all the water going?

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,300
MARCO: Wait... hear that dripping?

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:19,700
MARCO: This old pipe is leaking! The water never reaches the plants.

5
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,900
MR. OMAR: Fix the leak first. Then let the sky help you.

6
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,900
MR. OMAR: One millimeter of rain on one square meter gives one liter of water.

7
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,300
SAM: Special delivery! Reusable containers!

8
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,300
LEO: We can catch the rain from the roof!

9
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,700
MARCO: Let's build it together!

10
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:44,900
MR. OMAR: Science plus teamwork. That's how small ideas grow.

11
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:49,100
LEO: Look! The tanks are filling up!

12
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:54,300
LEO: One small idea... saved our whole garden!

13
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,100
MR. OMAR: Think smart. Save water. Change the world.
